{"articleNo":"183936","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=183936&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"제6회 G-Star 대학생 창업경진대회 견학 및 경품 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2017.11.24","hit":"2985","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">안녕하세요 창업교육센터입니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">당초 11/23(목)에 위덕대에서 진행예정이였던 행사가 경북 포항지역 지진으로 인해</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">행사 일정 및 장소가 변경되어 견학생을 재모집하려고 합니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">아래의 안내사항을 보시고 견학을 희망하는 학생이 있으시면 신청 부탁드립니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">* 견학가는 학생들에게는 소정의 기념품 제공</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u>* 선착순 30명 모집</u></span></font></strong></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u></u></span></font></strong></font>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 일정 : <font color=\"#0900ff\"><strong><u>12. 1.(금), 13시~</u></strong></font></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 장소 : 영남대학교 천마아트센터 챔버홀</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3. 신청방법 : <u><strong>학과/학번/성명/연락처/주민등록번호(여행자보험 가입) 기재하여 메일송부</strong></u></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">* <a href=\"mailto:startup@kumoh.ac.kr\"><u>startup@kumoh.ac.kr</u></a></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">4. 문의처 : 창업교육센터(054-478-7899)</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">5. 행사 일정 : 본교에서 버스로 함께 이동 예정</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><!--StartFragment--></span></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; mso-table-overlap: never\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 59.6pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 12.82pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">구분</span></font></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 79.41pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 12.82pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">시간</span></font></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000